No difference with fountains.  Negative luck hurts your
chances of getting a throne wish.  Note that negative
luck effects what you get when you do get a wish.

> 2. Speaking of wishes, what is the maximum enchantment you should wish
> for - +2 blessed rustproof corrodeproof?

As long as your luck is 0+, +2 always gets you +2 so that
is the conservative number.  At +3 there's a chance of
getting a +0 but the chances end up with an average over
2, so it's the optimal number unless you have a specific
need.  +4 and over the chances decline rapidly.

So +2 or +3?  It depends on your context.


